{
 "thread": "G4h8pGrLdZ0",
 "subject": "Dynamically generated widgets – inputs not loaded or updated - best practices",
 "messages_listed": 5,
 "last_activity": "2014-12-03T08:45:25Z",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "Oj1mgDdAGg8J",
   "from": "Eze",
   "author": "f81764dfe3800398",
   "date": "2014-12-02T11:39:12Z",
   "subject": "Dynamically generated widgets – inputs not loaded or updated - best practices",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">When I use dynamically generated widgets there is a time\r\ndelay until the widget gets created or updated that causes momentary problems\r\nin the execution of the application. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The following is a simple example. The selectInput widget “a”\r\nallows selecting values “A” or “B”. The dynamically created selectInput widget “b”\r\nallows selecting “A1” or “A2” when input$a is “A”, and “B1” or “B2” when\r\ninput$a is “B”. The output text control “txt” simply displays the value of\r\ninput$b. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">There are however two problems. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">First, when the application is first loaded, the renderText\r\nfunction throws an error because input$b is NULL. A moment later input$b is\r\nloaded, but you can see the error (I call it “error of type I”) in the console.\r\n <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Second, when the value of the selectInput widget “a”\r\nchanges, the renderText function throws an error because input$a and the first\r\nletter of input$b are different (I make this throw an error on purpose to\r\nillustrate the case when the selectInput widget “b” has not been updated). I\r\ncall this an “error of type II”.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ideally, it should never be the case that input$b is NULL or\r\nthat input$a and the first letter of input$b are different. Is there a clean\r\nway of making the renderText function wait until input$b has been properly\r\nloaded/updated?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">By the way, it is easy to catch the event that input$b is\r\nNULL. Catching the event of input$b not being updated is more difficult. In any\r\ncase, I’m looking for a best practice for dealing with these type of issues.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Help is much appreciated!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">ui.R</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">shinyUI(fluidPage(</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">  selectInput(&quot;a&quot;,label =\r\nh5(&quot;a&quot;),choices = c(&quot;A&quot;,&quot;B&quot;)),</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">  uiOutput(&quot;ui_b&quot;),</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">  h1(textOutput(&quot;txt&quot;)) </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">))</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">server.R</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">shinyServer(function(input,output) { </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">  output$ui_b &lt;- renderUI({</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">   \r\nselectInput(&quot;b&quot;,label = h5(&quot;b&quot;),choices =\r\nc(paste(input$a,&quot;1&quot;),paste(input$a,&quot;2&quot;)),selected=paste(input$a,&quot;1&quot;))</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">  })</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">  output$txt &lt;- renderText({</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">    if (is.null(input$b)==1){stop(&quot;Error\r\ntype I&quot;)}</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">    if (input$a!=substring(input$b,1,1)\r\n){stop(&quot;Error type II&quot;)}</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">    input$b</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">  })</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">  })</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hUIRm_6e7XMJ",
   "from": "Herman Sontrop",
   "author": "e6d426c9552b1af9",
   "date": "2014-12-02T21:28:00Z",
   "subject": "Dynamically generated widgets – inputs not loaded or updated - best practices",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "For must uses it suffices to just add this:\r<br>\r<br>if(is.null(input$x)) return()\r<br>\r<br>Furthermore, the development version of shiny has a few new event functions which should help you out! See observeEvent:\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/master/NEWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/master/NEWS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401212345000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3H9ngXcrN2cL694HMfvYdF\">https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/master/NEWS</a>\r<br>\r<br>best Herman"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hsH1W2J6YHgJ",
   "from": "Eze",
   "author": "f81764dfe3800398",
   "date": "2014-12-02T22:10:36Z",
   "subject": "Dynamically generated widgets – inputs not loaded or updated - best practices",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Thanks, Herman. Is.null solves the issue of the input not having been loaded, but how can I capture the input not having been updated?"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "NLva2YNjcdsJ",
   "from": "Joe Cheng",
   "author": "ca443e6eaa0e78ed",
   "date": "2014-12-02T22:25:05Z",
   "subject": "Re: Dynamically generated widgets – inputs not loaded or updated - best practices",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;d add the following reactive:<div><br></div><div>b &lt;- reactive({</div><div>  validate(need(input$b, FALSE))</div><div>  validate(need(regexpr(input$a, input$b, fixed=TRUE) == 1, FALSE))</div><div>  input$b</div><div>})</div><div><br></div><div>Then everywhere else you currently refer to input$b, call b() instead. This&#39;ll silently terminate the caller (by raising a special type of error) until input$b has an appropriate value.</div><div><br></div><div>Oh, and you also don&#39;t need to worry about b() return NULL either--it never will.</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Dec 2, 2014 at 2:10 PM, Eze <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ezequie...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Thanks, Herman. Is.null solves the issue of the input not having been loaded, but how can I capture the input not having been updated?<br>\r\n</blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span><br>\r\n--<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n</span>To view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/492509f1-887b-4921-9dec-d49ef6db7a62%40googlegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/492509f1-887b-4921-9dec-d49ef6db7a62%2540googlegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401212345000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26vs90NnGr29wmYSglt2oF\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/492509f1-887b-4921-9dec-d49ef6db7a62%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n<div><div>For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401212345000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28ko70jslIr3FbYJ8woylT\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></div></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
