     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Tuesday, December 2, 2014 10:25:05 PM UTC, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;d add the following reactive:<div><br></div><div>b &lt;- reactive({</div><div>  validate(need(input$b, FALSE))</div><div>  validate(need(regexpr(input$a, input$b, fixed=TRUE) == 1, FALSE))</div><div>  input$b</div><div>})</div><div><br></div><div>Then everywhere else you currently refer to input$b, call b() instead. This&#39;ll silently terminate the caller (by raising a special type of error) until input$b has an appropriate value.</div><div><br></div><div>Oh, and you also don&#39;t need to worry about b() return NULL either--it never will.</div></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Dec 2, 2014 at 2:10 PM, Eze <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">ezequie...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Thanks, Herman. Is.null solves the issue of the input not having been loaded, but how can I capture the input not having been updated?<br>\r\n<span><br>\r\n--<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n</span>To view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/492509f1-887b-4921-9dec-d49ef6db7a62%40googlegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/492509f1-887b-4921-9dec-d49ef6db7a62%2540googlegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401212346000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ppAmAYSkkdln4G3FvvbeN\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/492509f1-887b-4921-9dec-d49ef6db7a62%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n<div><div>For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401212346000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a_oq29RuO5SJrTQrBmOLb\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></div></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
